[345.206249, "o", "evt-00174|An attempt was made to duplicate a handle to an object.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-4228717743-1032521047-1810997296-1104\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tm.ward\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x10A7DF\r\r\n\r\r\nSource Handle Information:\r\r\n\tSource Handle ID:\t0xec\r\r\n\tSource Process ID:\t0x1f68\r\r\n\r\r\nNew Handle Information:\r\r\n\tTarget Handle ID:\t0x2204\r\r\n\tTarget Process ID:\t0x4|\r\n"]
